1
00:00:00,891 --> 00:00:04,393
You were able to see a future for me.

2
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:06,154
You talked to me about doing things.

3
00:00:06,994 --> 00:00:10,256
As if... as if it were obvious that I'd still be here.

4
00:00:10,376 --> 00:00:13,678
That made me so very happy.

5
00:00:19,461 --> 00:00:22,782
So yes, I am sure you're the one for me.

6
00:00:22,822 --> 00:00:27,005
Would you... Would you be my husband?

7
00:00:27,085 --> 00:00:27,385
Yes.

8
00:00:29,022 --> 00:00:33,684
I promise to become stronger than anyone and protect you for the rest of my life.

